{"id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#def:mapping-cylinder","title":"def:mapping-cylinder","path":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0.md","line":12,"body":"","kind":"definition","status":"not_started","tex":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0.tex#def:mapping-cylinder","uses":[],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0.tex","label":"def:mapping-cylinder","line":26,"source":"\\begin{definition}[Mapping cylinder]\n\\label{def:mapping-cylinder}\n\n\n\\group{Homotopy Theory}\n\n\nFor a map $f:X\\to Y$, the \\textbf{mapping cylinder} $M_f$ is the quotient of\n$(X\\times I)\\sqcup Y$ by $(x,1)\\sim f(x)$.\n\\end{definition}\n\nThe mapping cylinder deformation retracts onto $Y$ by moving $[x,t]$ to $[x,1]=f(x)$.","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Definition</div></section>[Mapping cylinder] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6465663a6d617070696e672d63796c696e646572\"></span> <p></p>\\group Homotopy Theory <p></p>For a map <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$f:X\\to Y$\">$f:X\\to Y$</span>, the <strong>mapping cylinder</strong> <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$M_f$\">$M_f$</span> is the quotient of <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(X\\times I)\\sqcup Y$\">$(X\\times I)\\sqcup Y$</span> by <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(x,1)\\sim f(x)$\">$(x,1)\\sim f(x)$</span>.  <p></p>The mapping cylinder deformation retracts onto <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$Y$\">$Y$</span> by moving <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$[x,t]$\">$[x,t]$</span> to <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$[x,1]=f(x)$\">$[x,1]=f(x)$</span>.","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: group"]},"previous":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#def:deformation-retraction","next":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#def:homotopy","relations":[],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#ex:house-with-two-rooms-contractible","title":"ex:house-with-two-rooms-contractible","label":"ex:house-with-two-rooms-contractible"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#ex:mapping-cylinder-neighborhood-hep","title":"ex:mapping-cylinder-neighborhood-hep","label":"ex:mapping-cylinder-neighborhood-hep"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#lem:mapping-cylinder-pair-hep","title":"lem:mapping-cylinder-pair-hep","label":"lem:mapping-cylinder-pair-hep"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#cor:homotopy-equivalence-iff-deformation-retract-mapping-cylinder","title":"cor:homotopy-equivalence-iff-deformation-retract-mapping-cylinder","label":"cor:homotopy-equivalence-iff-deformation-retract-mapping-cylinder"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#ex:torus-knot-complement-fundamental-group","title":"ex:torus-knot-complement-fundamental-group","label":"ex:torus-knot-complement-fundamental-group"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#def:graph-of-groups","title":"def:graph-of-groups","label":"def:graph-of-groups"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#def:mapping-cylinder","title":"def:mapping-cylinder","tex":"\\begin{definition}[Mapping cylinder]\n\\label{def:mapping-cylinder}\n\n\n\\group{Homotopy Theory}\n\n\nFor a map $f:X\\to Y$, the \\textbf{mapping cylinder} $M_f$ is the quotient of\n$(X\\times I)\\sqcup Y$ by $(x,1)\\sim f(x)$.\n\\end{definition}\n\nThe mapping cylinder deformation retracts onto $Y$ by moving $[x,t]$ to $[x,1]=f(x)$.","source":"tex/references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0.tex","description":"","dependencies":[],"dependencies_omitted":0,"unresolved_dependencies":[],"unresolved_omitted":0}}